  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Narrator
    Text: "N\u1EBFu t\xECnh tr\u1EA1ng tr\u1EDF n\xEAn nghi\xEAm tr\u1ECDng, h\xE3y
      t\xECm \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1EF1 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 chuy\xEAn nghi\u1EC7p. \u1EDE
      Vi\u1EC7t Nam, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi **T\u1ED5ng \u0111\xE0i Qu\u1ED1c
      gia B\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 Tr\u1EBB em 111** \u2013 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xE2y n\xF3ng
      mi\u1EC5n ph\xED, ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng 24/7. T\u1EA1i \u0111\xE2y, c\xE1c
      chuy\xEAn vi\xEAn s\u1EBD t\u01B0 v\u1EA5n, can thi\u1EC7p v\xE0 k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i
      v\u1EDBi c\u01A1 quan ch\u1EE9c n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 tr\u1EBB
      em"
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  ParentNodes:
  - {fileID: -5495639235092302782}
  ChildNode: {fileID: 2903454752184217831}
